{"seq":4,"slug":"governance-compliance","title":"治理与合规","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-infrastructure-mlops/automl-and-platforms/governance-compliance","wordCount":1560,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"治理与合规\">治理与合规</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>ML 治理（ML Governance）是确保机器学习系统的开发和运营符合组织政策、行业标准和法律法规的管理框架。随着 ML 系统越来越多地影响商业决策和用户体验，治理与合规从&quot;锦上添花&quot;变为&quot;必须具备&quot;。特别是在金融、医疗、保险等受监管行业，缺乏治理的 ML 系统可能面临巨额罚款和声誉损害。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[ML 治理框架] --&gt; B[模型审计]&#10;    A --&gt; C[数据隐私]&#10;    A --&gt; D[可解释性]&#10;    A --&gt; E[公平性]&#10;    B --&gt; F[版本追踪]&#10;    B --&gt; G[决策记录]&#10;    C --&gt; H[数据脱敏]&#10;    C --&gt; I[访问控制]&#10;    D --&gt; J[特征重要性]&#10;    E --&gt; K[偏差检测]\">graph TB\n    A[ML 治理框架] --&gt; B[模型审计]\n    A --&gt; C[数据隐私]\n    A --&gt; D[可解释性]\n    A --&gt; E[公平性]\n    B --&gt; F[版本追踪]\n    B --&gt; G[决策记录]\n    C --&gt; H[数据脱敏]\n    C --&gt; I[访问控制]\n    D --&gt; J[特征重要性]\n    E --&gt; K[偏差检测]</pre><p>ML 治理涵盖模型生命周期的每个阶段，从数据收集到模型退役都需要遵循治理规范。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>治理维度</th>\n<th>核心要求</th>\n<th>涉及法规</th>\n<th>违规风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据隐私</td>\n<td>用户数据保护和最小化收集</td>\n<td>GDPR, CCPA</td>\n<td>高额罚款</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模型审计</td>\n<td>可追溯的模型决策记录</td>\n<td>SOX, Basel III</td>\n<td>监管处罚</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>公平性</td>\n<td>避免对特定群体的歧视</td>\n<td>EU AI Act, 平权法</td>\n<td>诉讼 + 声誉损失</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可解释性</td>\n<td>提供模型决策的解释</td>\n<td>EU AI Act, ECOA</td>\n<td>合规不通过</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安全性</td>\n<td>防止模型被恶意利用</td>\n<td>NIST AI RMF</td>\n<td>安全事故</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"模型审计与追踪\">模型审计与追踪</h2><p>模型审计（Model Audit）是对模型的开发过程、训练数据、性能表现和部署决策进行系统化记录和审查的过程。完整的审计追踪使组织能够回答&quot;这个模型是怎么做出这个决策的&quot;这一关键问题。</p>\n<p>Model Card 是 Google 提出的模型文档标准，它为每个模型创建一张&quot;身份证&quot;，记录模型的用途、训练数据、性能指标、已知局限性和使用建议。Model Card 不仅是内部文档，也是向外部审计方和监管机构展示模型治理实践的重要工具。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from dataclasses import dataclass&#10;&#10;@dataclass&#10;class ModelCard:&#10;    model_name: str&#10;    version: str&#10;    description: str&#10;    intended_use: str&#10;    training_data: dict&#10;    evaluation_metrics: dict&#10;    limitations: list[str]&#10;    ethical_considerations: list[str]&#10;    fairness_analysis: dict&#10;&#10;    def generate_report(self):&#10;        return {&#10;            &quot;model_details&quot;: {&#10;                &quot;name&quot;: self.model_name,&#10;                &quot;version&quot;: self.version,&#10;                &quot;description&quot;: self.description,&#10;            },&#10;            &quot;intended_use&quot;: self.intended_use,&#10;            &quot;training_data&quot;: self.training_data,&#10;            &quot;performance&quot;: self.evaluation_metrics,&#10;            &quot;limitations&quot;: self.limitations,&#10;            &quot;ethical_considerations&quot;: self.ethical_considerations,&#10;            &quot;fairness&quot;: self.fairness_analysis,&#10;            &quot;generated_at&quot;: datetime.utcnow().isoformat(),&#10;        }&#10;&#10;card = ModelCard(&#10;    model_name=&quot;credit-scoring-v3&quot;,&#10;    version=&quot;3.2.1&quot;,&#10;    description=&quot;信用评分模型&quot;,&#10;    intended_use=&quot;评估个人贷款申请的信用风险&quot;,&#10;    training_data={&#10;        &quot;source&quot;: &quot;内部贷款历史数据&quot;,&#10;        &quot;size&quot;: &quot;500万条记录&quot;,&#10;        &quot;time_range&quot;: &quot;2020-2024&quot;,&#10;        &quot;protected_attributes_removed&quot;: [&quot;race&quot;, &quot;gender&quot;],&#10;    },&#10;    evaluation_metrics={&quot;auc&quot;: 0.82, &quot;ks&quot;: 0.45},&#10;    limitations=[&quot;对新移民群体的评估准确度较低&quot;],&#10;    ethical_considerations=[&quot;已排除种族和性别特征&quot;],&#10;    fairness_analysis={&quot;demographic_parity_diff&quot;: 0.03},&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dataclasses </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dataclass</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@dataclass</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ModelCard</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    model_name: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    version: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    description: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    intended_use: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    training_data: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dict</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    evaluation_metrics: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dict</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    limitations: list[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ethical_considerations: list[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    fairness_analysis: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dict</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> generate_report</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"model_details\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.model_name,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                \"version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.version,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                \"description\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.description,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"intended_use\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.intended_use,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"training_data\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.training_data,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"performance\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.evaluation_metrics,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"limitations\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.limitations,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"ethical_considerations\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.ethical_considerations,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"fairness\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.fairness_analysis,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"generated_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: datetime.utcnow().isoformat(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">card </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ModelCard(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    model_name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"credit-scoring-v3\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"3.2.1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    description</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"信用评分模型\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    intended_use</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"评估个人贷款申请的信用风险\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    training_data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"source\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"内部贷款历史数据\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"size\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"500万条记录\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"time_range\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2020-2024\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"protected_attributes_removed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"race\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"gender\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    evaluation_metrics</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"auc\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.82</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ks\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.45</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    limitations</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"对新移民群体的评估准确度较低\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    ethical_considerations</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"已排除种族和性别特征\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    fairness_analysis</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"demographic_parity_diff\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.03</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>决策日志（Decision Log）记录模型在生产环境中每次预测的完整上下文：输入特征值、模型版本、预测结果、置信度和处理时间。对于高风险应用（如信贷审批），决策日志需要保留足够长的时间（通常 5-7 年）以满足监管要求。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数据隐私保护\">数据隐私保护</h2><p>ML 系统在训练和推理过程中大量使用个人数据，数据隐私保护是治理的核心维度。GDPR（通用数据保护条例）和 CCPA（加州消费者隐私法案）对个人数据的收集、存储、使用和删除提出了严格要求。</p>\n<p>数据最小化原则要求只收集和使用与 ML 任务直接相关的最少数据。在特征工程阶段，应评估每个特征是否真正必要——如果移除某个特征后模型性能无显著下降，该特征可能不应该被收集。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[原始数据] --&gt; B{隐私评估}&#10;    B --&gt; C[匿名化]&#10;    B --&gt; D[假名化]&#10;    B --&gt; E[差分隐私]&#10;    C --&gt; F[安全训练数据]&#10;    D --&gt; F&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt; G[模型训练]&#10;    G --&gt; H{模型隐私测试}&#10;    H --&gt;|通过| I[部署]&#10;    H --&gt;|泄漏| J[加强保护]\">graph LR\n    A[原始数据] --&gt; B{隐私评估}\n    B --&gt; C[匿名化]\n    B --&gt; D[假名化]\n    B --&gt; E[差分隐私]\n    C --&gt; F[安全训练数据]\n    D --&gt; F\n    E --&gt; F\n    F --&gt; G[模型训练]\n    G --&gt; H{模型隐私测试}\n    H --&gt;|通过| I[部署]\n    H --&gt;|泄漏| J[加强保护]</pre><p>差分隐私（Differential Privacy）是在数据分析和模型训练中保护个体隐私的数学框架。它通过在数据或梯度中注入校准噪声，确保模型的输出不会泄露任何单个训练样本的信息。DP-SGD（Differentially Private SGD）在每步梯度更新中裁剪和加噪梯度，是在深度学习训练中实现差分隐私的标准方法。</p>\n<p>联邦学习（Federated Learning）是另一种保护数据隐私的方法。它允许多方在不共享原始数据的情况下协作训练模型——每方在本地数据上训练模型，只上传模型参数的更新（而非原始数据）到中央服务器进行聚合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"可解释性与透明度\">可解释性与透明度</h2><p>模型可解释性（Explainability）是向用户、审计方和监管机构解释模型决策依据的能力。EU AI Act 将高风险 AI 系统（如信用评估、招聘筛选、执法辅助）的可解释性列为法定要求。</p>\n<p>SHAP（SHapley Additive exPlanations）是当前最广泛使用的模型解释方法。它基于博弈论中的 Shapley 值，为每次预测计算每个特征对预测结果的贡献度。SHAP 值的优势是理论上严谨、满足一致性和可加性等数学性质。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import shap&#10;&#10;explainer = shap.TreeExplainer(model)&#10;shap_values = explainer(test_data)&#10;&#10;shap.summary_plot(shap_values, test_data, show=False)&#10;&#10;def generate_explanation(model, explainer, instance):&#10;    shap_values = explainer(instance)&#10;    feature_contributions = dict(&#10;        zip(instance.columns, shap_values.values[0])&#10;    )&#10;    sorted_contributions = sorted(&#10;        feature_contributions.items(), key=lambda x: abs(x[1]), reverse=True&#10;    )&#10;&#10;    explanation = {&#10;        &quot;prediction&quot;: model.predict(instance)[0],&#10;        &quot;base_value&quot;: shap_values.base_values[0],&#10;        &quot;top_factors&quot;: [&#10;            {&quot;feature&quot;: name, &quot;contribution&quot;: float(value)}&#10;            for name, value in sorted_contributions[:5]&#10;        ],&#10;    }&#10;    return explanation\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> shap</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">explainer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> shap.TreeExplainer(model)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">shap_values </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> explainer(test_data)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">shap.summary_plot(shap_values, test_data, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">show</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">False</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> generate_explanation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(model, explainer, instance):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    shap_values </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> explainer(instance)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    feature_contributions </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> dict</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        zip</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(instance.columns, shap_values.values[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    sorted_contributions </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sorted</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        feature_contributions.items(), </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=lambda</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">abs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(x[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]), </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">reverse</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    explanation </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"prediction\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: model.predict(instance)[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"base_value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: shap_values.base_values[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"top_factors\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"feature\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: name, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"contribution\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(value)}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> name, value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sorted_contributions[:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> explanation</span></span></code></pre></div><p>LIME（Local Interpretable Model-agnostic Explanations）通过在预测点周围生成扰动样本并拟合线性模型来解释单个预测。它的优势是模型无关性——可以解释任何黑盒模型。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>解释方法</th>\n<th>范围</th>\n<th>模型依赖</th>\n<th>计算成本</th>\n<th>理论基础</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>SHAP</td>\n<td>全局/局部</td>\n<td>部分依赖</td>\n<td>中-高</td>\n<td>Shapley 值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LIME</td>\n<td>局部</td>\n<td>无关</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>局部线性近似</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>注意力可视化</td>\n<td>局部</td>\n<td>Transformer</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>注意力权重</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>特征重要性</td>\n<td>全局</td>\n<td>树模型</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>信息增益</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"公平性评估与偏差缓解\">公平性评估与偏差缓解</h2><p>ML 模型可能在训练数据中学习并放大社会偏见，导致对特定群体的歧视性预测。公平性评估（Fairness Assessment）检测模型是否对不同群体（按性别、种族、年龄等敏感属性划分）产生不公平的差异性影响。</p>\n<p>常用的公平性指标包括人口统计学均等（Demographic Parity，不同群体的正预测率应相等）、均等化赔率（Equalized Odds，不同群体的真正率和假正率应相等）和校准（Calibration，预测概率在不同群体中应同样准确）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"class FairnessAnalyzer:&#10;    def __init__(self, predictions, labels, sensitive_attribute):&#10;        self.predictions = predictions&#10;        self.labels = labels&#10;        self.groups = sensitive_attribute&#10;&#10;    def demographic_parity(self):&#10;        results = {}&#10;        for group in self.groups.unique():&#10;            mask = self.groups == group&#10;            positive_rate = self.predictions[mask].mean()&#10;            results[group] = positive_rate&#10;&#10;        max_diff = max(results.values()) - min(results.values())&#10;        return {&#10;            &quot;group_rates&quot;: results,&#10;            &quot;max_difference&quot;: max_diff,&#10;            &quot;passes_threshold&quot;: max_diff &lt; 0.05,&#10;        }&#10;&#10;    def equalized_odds(self):&#10;        results = {}&#10;        for group in self.groups.unique():&#10;            mask = self.groups == group&#10;            tp_rate = self._true_positive_rate(mask)&#10;            fp_rate = self._false_positive_rate(mask)&#10;            results[group] = {&quot;tpr&quot;: tp_rate, &quot;fpr&quot;: fp_rate}&#10;        return results\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FairnessAnalyzer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, predictions, labels, sensitive_attribute):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.predictions </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> predictions</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.labels </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> labels</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.groups </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sensitive_attribute</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> demographic_parity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        results </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> group </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.groups.unique():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            mask </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.groups </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> group</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            positive_rate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.predictions[mask].mean()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            results[group] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> positive_rate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        max_diff </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(results.values()) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(results.values())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"group_rates\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: results,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"max_difference\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: max_diff,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"passes_threshold\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: max_diff </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.05</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> equalized_odds</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        results </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> group </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.groups.unique():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            mask </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.groups </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> group</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            tp_rate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">._true_positive_rate(mask)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            fp_rate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">._false_positive_rate(mask)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            results[group] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tpr\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: tp_rate, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"fpr\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: fp_rate}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> results</span></span></code></pre></div><p>偏差缓解策略分为三类：预处理（在训练数据中平衡不同群体的样本或去除偏差特征）、训练中处理（在损失函数中加入公平性约束或使用对抗训练）和后处理（调整不同群体的决策阈值以达到公平性目标）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[偏差检测] --&gt; B{偏差类型}&#10;    B --&gt;|数据偏差| C[预处理缓解]&#10;    B --&gt;|模型偏差| D[训练中缓解]&#10;    B --&gt;|输出偏差| E[后处理缓解]&#10;    C --&gt; F[重采样/重加权]&#10;    D --&gt; G[公平性约束损失]&#10;    E --&gt; H[阈值调整]&#10;    F --&gt; I[公平模型]&#10;    G --&gt; I&#10;    H --&gt; I\">graph TB\n    A[偏差检测] --&gt; B{偏差类型}\n    B --&gt;|数据偏差| C[预处理缓解]\n    B --&gt;|模型偏差| D[训练中缓解]\n    B --&gt;|输出偏差| E[后处理缓解]\n    C --&gt; F[重采样/重加权]\n    D --&gt; G[公平性约束损失]\n    E --&gt; H[阈值调整]\n    F --&gt; I[公平模型]\n    G --&gt; I\n    H --&gt; I</pre><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((治理与合规))&#10;    模型审计&#10;      Model Card&#10;      决策日志&#10;      版本追踪&#10;    数据隐私&#10;      差分隐私&#10;      联邦学习&#10;      数据最小化&#10;    可解释性&#10;      SHAP&#10;      LIME&#10;      注意力可视化&#10;    公平性&#10;      偏差检测&#10;      公平性指标&#10;      缓解策略\">mindmap\n  root((治理与合规))\n    模型审计\n      Model Card\n      决策日志\n      版本追踪\n    数据隐私\n      差分隐私\n      联邦学习\n      数据最小化\n    可解释性\n      SHAP\n      LIME\n      注意力可视化\n    公平性\n      偏差检测\n      公平性指标\n      缓解策略</pre><ul>\n<li>ML 治理是确保 ML 系统合规、可信和负责任的管理框架，在受监管行业中是法定要求</li>\n<li>Model Card 和决策日志是模型审计的核心文档，需要在模型生命周期中持续维护</li>\n<li>差分隐私和联邦学习是保护训练数据隐私的两种互补方案</li>\n<li>SHAP 是当前最成熟的可解释性工具，为每个预测提供有理论保障的特征贡献度分析</li>\n<li>公平性评估应在模型上线前和运行中持续进行，偏差缓解可在预处理、训练和后处理三个阶段介入</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"治理与合规","id":"治理与合规"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"模型审计与追踪","id":"模型审计与追踪"},{"level":2,"text":"数据隐私保护","id":"数据隐私保护"},{"level":2,"text":"可解释性与透明度","id":"可解释性与透明度"},{"level":2,"text":"公平性评估与偏差缓解","id":"公平性评估与偏差缓解"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"成本优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-infrastructure-mlops/automl-and-platforms/cost-optimization"},"next":null}